*> MOVEs that lose characters or digits, and some that do not.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  SHORT-TEXT          PIC X(5).
01  LONG-TEXT           PIC X(20).
01  SMALL-NUM           PIC 9(3).
01  BIG-NUM             PIC S9(7)V99.
01  AMOUNT-OUT          PIC ZZ9.99.
01  TABLE-OF-CODES.
    05  CODE-ENTRY      PIC X(4) OCCURS 10 TIMES.
01  GROUP-A.
    05  FILLER          PIC X(30).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE "TOO LONG FOR IT" TO SHORT-TEXT
    MOVE "FITS" TO SHORT-TEXT LONG-TEXT
    MOVE LONG-TEXT TO SHORT-TEXT
    MOVE SHORT-TEXT TO LONG-TEXT
    MOVE 12345 TO SMALL-NUM
    MOVE 00123 TO SMALL-NUM
    MOVE 123.456 TO SMALL-NUM
    MOVE BIG-NUM TO SMALL-NUM AMOUNT-OUT
    MOVE SMALL-NUM TO BIG-NUM
    MOVE LONG-TEXT TO CODE-ENTRY(1)
    MOVE LONG-TEXT(1:4) TO CODE-ENTRY(2)
    MOVE GROUP-A TO LONG-TEXT
    MOVE SPACES TO SHORT-TEXT
    MOVE ALL "*" TO SHORT-TEXT
    MOVE X"414243444546" TO SHORT-TEXT
    STOP RUN.
